"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Version notes\">\n"
"- `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48.0 is recommended because it adds the `meas_level = \"both\"` option and the `local_c1` twirling group.\n"
"- `qiskit >= 2.3.0` is required.\n"
"- `samplomatic >= 0.18.0` is required.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notas de versión\">\n"
"- Se recomienda `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.48.0 porque agrega la opción `meas_level = \"both\"` y el grupo de twirling `local_c1`.\n"
"- Se requiere `qiskit >= 2.3.0`.\n"
"- Se requiere `samplomatic >= 0.18.0`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

